        "original_id": "0d0db60f-ab26-5258-bcc3-2b98545f9584",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Realex Payments, Paddy Power\n- Products: payment gateway services\n- Places: Dublin, Ireland\n- Topics: transaction processing, corporate founding\n\nFacts:\n- Paddy Power was founded in 1988 in Dublin, Ireland.\n- Realex Payments provides a broad range of payment gateway services.\n- Realex Payments processes transactions exceeding €35 billion per year for more than 14,000 clients.\n- Realex Payments' clients include Paddy Power, Virgin Atlantic Airways, Vodafone Ireland, the AA, AXA Insurance, and Aer Lingus.\n- Paddy Power is an Irish bookmaker.",
